  <name>HTS Time System</name>
  <summary>An infinite, cyclical deep-time calendar</summary>
  <description>
    <p>The Storcke Human Time System (HTS) is an infinite, cyclical calendar designed for deep time. It starts at A0 (40,000 years pre-2023) and uses Epochs lasting 50,000 years.</p>
    <p>This application provides a graphical interface, an interactive control panel, a video screensaver engine, and a command-line tool.</p>
  </description>
